# Simple Flashcards

Parallel module — **not** vocab `decks` / SM-2.

## Data

- `simple_decks`, `simple_cards` (front/back strings only), `simple_card_stats`, `simple_learning_sessions`
- Indexes via `python src/init_indexes.py` (not on server startup)

## API (`/simple/...`)

- CRUD decks/cards + `GET /simple/search?q=` (title, front, back)
- Study: start → grade `{remembered}` → forgot requeues to end; stats `forget_count` / `remember_count`
- Do not call `services.update_user_progress`

## FE

- `/simple`, `/simple/:id`, `/simple/study?deck_id=`
- Nav link **Simple**; use `useApi()` + `SimpleFlashcard.vue`
